    {
      "uid": "zhcn:727e92018119cdbce99c44f2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我在电视上看见了赛马娘歌牌大赛！\n你强悍又华丽的表现……\n正好符合我们旅馆的形象！",
      "source_fingerprint": "824df2f2bc3a565cb11e347eb6ae0fcfbe4b714679b45a4954a2fbefa6cf9ef0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
